1
00:00:00,204 --> 00:00:02,244
(Leonard:)Excuse me?

2
00:00:02,414 --> 00:00:03,664
(Sheldon:)She's my twin sister.

3
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:07,173
(Sheldon:)She thinks she's funny, but frankly,
I've never been able to see it.

4
00:00:07,336 --> 00:00:10,126
That's because you have
no measurable sense of humor, Shelly.

5
00:00:10,297 --> 00:00:12,797
(Sheldon:)How exactly would one measure
a sense of humor?

6
00:00:12,967 --> 00:00:15,097
A humormometer?

7
00:00:17,888 --> 00:00:21,268
(Howard:)Well, I think you're delightfully droll.
Or as the French say:

8
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:23,143
[SPEAKS IN FRENCH]

9
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:27,770
(Missy:)Okay, so let me see if I got this.
Leonard, Howard and...

10
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,230
I'm sorry, what was your name again?

11
00:00:56,844 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)Rajesh.

